    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Job Says Friends Are Miserable Comforters"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then Job responded,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“I have heard many things like these;",
          "Miserable comforters are you all!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“Is there no end to windy words?",
          "Or what provokes you that you answer?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“I too could speak like you,",
          "If only I were in your place.",
          "I could compose words against you",
          "And shake my head at you."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“Or I could strengthen you with my mouth,",
          "And the condolence of my lips could lessen your pain."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Job Says God Shattered Him"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¶“If I speak, my pain is not lessened,",
          "And if I refrain, what pain leaves me?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“But now He has exhausted me;",
          "You have laid waste all my group of loved ones."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“And You have shriveled me up,",
          "It has become a witness;",
          "And my infirmity rises up against me,",
          "It testifies to my face."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“His anger has torn me and hunted me down,",
          "He has gnashed at me with His teeth;",
          "My enemy glares at me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“They have gaped at me with their mouths,",
          "They have slapped me on the cheek with contempt;",
          "They have massed themselves against me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“God hands me over to criminals,",
          "And tosses me into the hands of the wicked."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“I was at ease, but He shattered me,",
          "And He has grasped me by my neck and shaken me to pieces;",
          "He has also set me up as His target."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“His arrows surround me.",
          "He splits my kidneys open without mercy;",
          "He pours out my bile on the ground."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“He breaks through me with breach after breach;",
          "He runs at me like a warrior."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“I have sewed sackcloth over my skin,",
          "And thrust my horn in the dust."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“My face is flushed from weeping,",
          "And deep darkness is on my eyelids,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Although there is no violence in my hands,",
          "And my prayer is pure."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¶“Earth, do not cover my blood,",
          "And may there be no resting place for my cry."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“Even now, behold, my witness is in heaven,",
          "And my advocate is on high."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“My friends are my scoffers;",
          "My eye weeps to God,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "That one might plead for a man with God",
          "As a son of man with his neighbor!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“For when a few years are past,",
          "I shall go the way of no return."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
